    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Weight stable; good energy</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No visual loss or diplopia</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hearing loss or swallowing difficulty</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or lightheadedness on standing</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough beyond a morning clearing of the throat; no breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No black stools or reflux</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Nocturia once; no hesitancy or hematuria</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No falls or joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new or changing skin lesions</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>Left hand slightly less nimble when tired; no new weakness, numbness, or speech change</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; tearfulness now rare; PHQ-9 score 3</td></tr><tr><td>Hematologic</td><td>Negative</td><td>No easy bruising or bleeding on clopidogrel</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

