    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with his consent, prompted by the stroke. He has named a health care agent and completed a written health care directive; a copy is now in the chart. He wants full treatment, including thrombolysis or thrombectomy, for another stroke from which he could return to work. He would not want prolonged tube feeding or mechanical ventilation after a severe stroke that left him unable to speak or recognize those close to him. He will review these wishes with his agent. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
